    "name": {
      "value": "Impenetrable Scale"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "is_core": {
      "value": true
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Made of overlapping, lustrous black scales of standard-grade adamantine, this +2 greater resilient fortification adamantine scale mail seems to momentarily thicken at the point of impact when hit. Whenever the armor's fortification rune successfully turns a significant foe's critical hit into a normal hit, one of the scales on the armor turns violet. You gain resistance to physical damage equal to the number of violet scales, to a maximum of 8.\n\nAt dawn each day, all the violet scales return to normal.\n\n**Craft Requirements:** The initial raw materials must include 1,600 gp of adamantine."
    },
